{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53203","headline":"诗偈 二十八 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先须持五戒，方始得人身。\n有财将布施，身即不穷贫。\n若行十善业，闻道得天人。\n天人生灭福，来去如车轮。\n有爲接梵世，不及一毫真。\n更欲谈玄妙，虑恐法王瞋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}